               "A long journey taught you that being useful was often more important than being impressive.","You once talked your way out of trouble and spent years wondering whether that made you clever or merely lucky.","A local dispute taught you how quickly a small disagreement can become somebody else's feud.","You helped repair or restore something that everyone else had already given up on.","You witnessed a piece of magic that you still cannot fully explain.","You were briefly employed by someone whose eccentric habits became the best story you had from that year.","You once followed a rumor simply because nobody else believed it, and found something stranger than the rumor.","You once had to choose between keeping a promise and protecting yourself.","A routine job became complicated when two people gave you different instructions.","You spent a season helping rebuild after a destructive storm.","You once found yourself responsible for an expensive mistake and chose to admit it.","A chance encounter introduced you to a skill you would never have sought out yourself.","You once worked alongside someone whose methods were completely unlike your own.","You had a promising opportunity disappear because you arrived one day too late.","You once discovered that a rumor about you was more widely believed than the truth.","A family obligation forced you to postpone a plan you cared about.","You once helped settle a dispute and learned that neither side was entirely honest.","You spent several months saving for something that never turned out to be worth the price.","You once got lost and discovered a route that became useful afterward.","A failed attempt at something difficult convinced you to practice instead of give up.","You once found yourself in a room where everyone knew something you did not.","You had a friendship end over a disagreement neither of you expected to become permanent.","You once accepted responsibility for a task because nobody else knew how to do it.","A small act of kindness from a stranger changed the course of one difficult year.","You once discovered that someone had been quietly helping you without taking credit.","You spent a long winter learning to live with less than you wanted.","You once realized that the life you were building was no longer the life you actually wanted.","You spent a year learning a trade that you never expected to enjoy.","You once had to finish an important job after everyone else involved walked away.","A chance conversation convinced you to leave a comfortable life for a less certain one.","You lost something important because you trusted the wrong person.","You once solved a problem by doing the one thing everyone else had dismissed as impractical.","You became responsible for someone else for a season and discovered you were better at it than expected.","You once crossed a province on foot after a journey went badly wrong.","A failed business venture taught you more than a successful one probably would have.","You were present when a local dispute nearly became a blood feud.","You once found yourself defending a person you did not particularly like because the alternative was worse.","You discovered that someone you admired was considerably less impressive up close.","You once spent months preparing for an opportunity that never arrived.","You became unusually good at a skill simply because nobody else around you knew how to do it.","You once took responsibility for a mistake that was not entirely yours.","A long illness in the family forced you to become useful before you felt ready.","You once traveled with strangers and returned home with a completely different idea of the world.","You survived a dangerous situation mostly because you remembered one small lesson at the right moment.","You once tried to leave town quietly and discovered that leaving quietly was harder than expected.","A lost opportunity convinced you that waiting for the perfect moment was a mistake.",