      "prisonChanges":[
         "You came out more cautious than you went in.",
         "You came out more determined to control your own life.","You learned not to confuse kindness with weakness.","You lost some of your old ambition and gained a stronger appreciation for ordinary freedom.","You still carry resentment toward the people who put you there.","You decided that if you ever got a second chance, you would not waste it.","You learned that pride was expensive and patience was usually cheaper.","You became less interested in impressing people and more interested in being useful.","You stopped assuming that authority and competence were the same thing.","You became more careful about the promises you make.","You decided that a quiet life sounded much better than it used to.","You learned that you could survive losing almost everything and still want to build something afterward.","You became more patient with slow progress.","You learned to keep your expectations realistic without giving up hope.","You became more protective of your personal freedom.","You stopped taking ordinary comforts for granted.","You became more suspicious of people who demand immediate trust.","You learned that routine can be a form of stability.","You became less concerned with appearances.","You decided to avoid debts whenever possible.","You became better at keeping calm when other people were panicking.","You learned to leave arguments before they became fights.","You became more careful about where you put your name.","You decided that being useful mattered more than being impressive.","You learned to notice opportunities without assuming they would save you.","You became more willing to change plans when circumstances demanded it.","You stopped believing that one failure had to define you.","You became more selective about the people you call friends.","You learned that freedom includes the right to make ordinary mistakes.","You became determined to own fewer things you could not afford to lose.","You developed a quiet dislike of unnecessary authority.","You decided that your next chapter should be built deliberately.","You became slower to trust and quicker to observe.","You came out with less patience for people who waste other people's time.","You learned to value choices that once seemed too ordinary to notice.","You became more comfortable saying no.","You stopped chasing approval from people who had never intended to give it.","You became more willing to leave a bad situation before it became a worse one.","You learned that independence can be lonely but is still worth having.","You became more deliberate with money.","You learned to keep promises to yourself as seriously as promises to others.","You became suspicious of grand plans and fond of practical ones.","You decided that your next life should contain fewer things you could not control.","You came out quieter than before, but not necessarily softer.","You learned that surviving something does not mean you have to let it define you.","You became more willing to ask for help before a problem became impossible.","You decided that if you ever had a home again, you would appreciate it properly.","You stopped assuming that respectable people were automatically trustworthy.","You became more careful about who knew your plans.","You developed a stronger dislike of locked doors.","You learned to distinguish what you actually wanted from what other people expected you to want.","You came out with a stubborn determination to make the next chapter yours.","You became slower to trust and quicker to observe.","You came out with less patience for people who waste other people's time.","You learned to value choices that once seemed too ordinary to notice.","You became more comfortable saying no.","You stopped chasing approval from people who had never intended to give it.","You became more willing to leave a bad situation before it became a worse one.","You learned that independence can be lonely but is still worth having.","You became more deliberate with money.","You learned to keep promises to yourself as seriously as promises to others.","You became suspicious of grand plans and fond of practical ones.","You decided that your next life should contain fewer things you could not control.","You came out quieter than before, but not necessarily softer.","You learned that surviving something does not mean you have to let it define you.","You became more willing to ask for help before a problem became impossible.","You decided that if you ever had a home again, you would appreciate it properly.","You stopped assuming that respectable people were automatically trustworthy.","You became more careful about who knew your plans.","You developed a stronger dislike of locked doors.","You learned to distinguish what you actually wanted from what other people expected you to want.","You came out with a stubborn determination to make the next chapter yours.","You became more patient with slow progress.","You learned to keep your expectations realistic without giving up hope.","You became more protective of your personal freedom.","You stopped taking ordinary comforts for granted.","You became more suspicious of people who demand immediate trust.","You learned that routine can be a form of stability.","You became less concerned with appearances.","You decided to avoid debts whenever possible.","You became better at keeping calm when other people were panicking.","You learned to leave arguments before they became fights.","You became more careful about where you put your name.","You decided that being useful mattered more than being impressive.","You learned to notice opportunities without assuming they would save you.","You became more willing to change plans when circumstances demanded it.","You stopped believing that one failure had to define you.","You became more selective about the people you call friends.","You learned that freedom includes the right to make ordinary mistakes.","You became determined to own fewer things you could not afford to lose.","You developed a quiet dislike of unnecessary authority.","You decided that your next chapter should be built deliberately."],

